plies will not be restored to your posts.\"),o(\"b4f917d0\",\"Miscellaneous\"),o(\"bdfa2b8c\",\"Additional resources\"),o(\"b8692262\",\"Check out other places for helpful information to learn more about X products and services.\"),o(\"c0398892\",\"Release notes\"),o(\"b833bcde\",\"Manage aspects of your X experience such as limiting color contrast and motion. These settings affect all the X accounts on this browser.\"),o(\"d5b646be\",\"Vision\"),o(\"jfe6a3a0\",\"Motion\"),o(\"e8c72272\",\"Increase color contrast\"),o(\"dba2cdd2\",\"Improves legibility by increasing the contrast between text and background colors.\"),o(\"d070244e\",\"Reduce motion\"),o(\"icfa5e8c\",\"Limits the amount of in-app animations, including live engagement counts.\"),o(\"ae41b002\",\"Limits the amount of in-app animations, including live engagement counts. Your system is currently signaling to reduce motion. If you would like to re-enable motion, first disable it there.\"),o(\"h9d1cfae\",\"Receive image description reminder\"),o(\"c878e9f8\",\"Enables a reminder to add image descriptions before a post can be sent.\"),o(\"bbd1fc7c\",\"Learn more about accessibility at X\"),o(\"ac865cf0\",\"Accessibility at X\"),o(\"f70cd5ee\",\"Phone\"),o(\"ib6f1694\",\"Account creation\"),o(\"hbd12156\",\"Request Verification\"),o(\"f70d5780\",\"Yes.\"),o(\"dc62d3c6\",\"No.\"),o(\"a67dbd0a\",\"Parody, commentary and fan account\"),o(\"a3db727e\",\"Manage your parody, commentary and fan account\"),o(\"eacf1990\",\"Add your date of birth to your profile.\"),o(\"a3bf1262\",\"Change your date of birth on your profile.\"),o(\"h530db16\",\"Protected posts\"),o(\"d6d80990\",\"This information applies to your browser or device while you’re logged out. It may be different when you’re logged in.\"),o(\"i0d81ddb\",\"your personalization and data settings\"),o(\"g2a9bd3e\",\"Automated Account Labels\"),o(\"dd9b3aae\",\"What’s an automated account?\"),o(\"b80bdc40\",\"Automated accounts are programmed to perform certain actions automatically through the X API. Like posting a region’s weather conditions, for example. They’re created and managed by other people on X.\"),o(\"a01ac9b6\",\"Labels let the world know who’s managing the automated account. Once an automated account owner has connected their managing account, a label will appear on the automated account profile and posts.\"),o(\"b989e1fe\",\"Do I need to label my automated accounts?\"),o(\"i2d599aa\",\"How do I label my automated account?\"),o(\"gd5bed72\",\"Create a managing account\"),o(\"g6d44432\",\"A managing account is the human-run account responsible for the automated account.\"),o(\"e20a69e8\",\"Connect your managing and automated account\"),o(\"d2f88358\",\"Connect your accounts from the Automation page in your settings.\"),o(\"e427f632\",\"Your account is labeled!\"),o(\"a4d7cffa\",\"Once the accounts are connected, the automated account will have a label.\"),o(\"a18d6a7d\",\"new rules\"),o(\"e9965c14\",\"automated account label FAQ\"),o(\"ee78c192\",\"What’s a PCF account?\"),o(\"c3f35e0c\",\"A PCF account depicts another person, group, or organization in their profile to discuss, satirize, or share information about that entity.\"),o(\"d019b5fa\",\"Do I need to label my PCF account?\"),o(\"dd04f24e\",\"Yes. The PCF label ensures people on X are not confused by your account, informing them that your account is not affiliated with the subject of the profile. If not labeled, your account may violate the Authenticity policy.\"),o(\"hb0f8bbc\",\"How do I label my PCF account?\"),o(\"g69acc5c\",\"Just click ‘Got it’, and we’ll take you to your profile settings to set an account label!\"),o(\"d313d431\",\"Authenticity policy\"),o(\"a3f22d8e\",\"Select the kinds of notifications you get about your activities, interests, and recommendations.\"),o(\"bc20979a\",\"X and its partners use cookies to provide you with a better, safer, and faster service and to support our business. Some cookies are necessary to use our services, improve our services, and make sure they work properly.\"),o(\"ge06dadc\",\"Allow X and its partners to use cookies to provide you with ads and communications tailored to your interests.\"),o(\"he20de3a\",\"Don’t allow X to use cookies to gather additional data for tailored ads and communications.\"),o(\"g0ec0bec\",\"Deactivated\"),o(\"g89f4614\",\"Your account is deactivated\"),o(\"f1768324\",\"Control how X personalizes content and collects and shares certain data.\"),o(\"ja94f34e\",\"These settings apply to this browser or device while you’re logged out. They don’t have any effect when you’re logged in.\"),o(\"bd73f7e6\",\"This will enable or disable all of the settings on this page.\"),o(\"ddbc3288\",\"Data\"),o(\"ae5339a0\",\"See your X data\"),o(\"b934e0ea\",\"Disable personalization and data?\"),o(\"i0317e0e\",\"This may make the posts and ads you see less relevant.\"),o(\"a148acba\",\"Disable\"),o(\"aa023546\",\"Personalize based on the places you’ve been\"),o(\"ced77194\",\"Allow use of where you see X content across the web\"),o(\"fe1fc83e\",\"These are the age ranges associated with you.\"),o(\"bf9c74d0\",\"Do not use these age ranges for personalization.\"),o(\"cf0daa24\",\"It may take a while to gather this information. Try again later.\"),o(\"ea522535\",\"Learn more\"),o(\"hf5ca8f8\",\"profile\"),o(\"d9cbe351\",function(e){return e.count+\" login event\"+r(e.count,\"\",\"s\")}),o(\"de90b04a\",\"Places you’ve been\"),o(\"cbd2ef59\",function(e){return e.count+\" location\"+r(e.count,\"\",\"s\")}),o(\"e1c6b2d6\",\"Tailored audiences\"),o(\"ed19d10d\",function(e){return e.audienceCount+\" audience\"+r(e.audienceCount,\"\",\"s\")+\" from \"+e.advertiserCount+\" advertiser\"+r(e.advertiserCount,\"\",\"s\")}),o(\"f00d0d03\",function(e){return e.count+\" interest\"+r(e.count,\"\",\"s\")}),o(\"hf9c2caa\",\"Request advertiser list?\"),o(\"c29b7971\",function(e){return\"This will be sent to \"+e.primaryEmail+\".\"}),o(\"a8276fac\",\"Request advertiser list\"),