d.\"),o(\"ed0e6b2e\",\"Start rating notes\"),o(\"if4c5e06\",\"Welcome to Community Notes!\"),o(\"g880a78a\",\"Start by rating notes\"),o(\"d1be2236\",\"Community Notes relies on contributors like you to help identify helpful notes to show to everyone.\"),o(\"af9f2b78\",\"Track your Rating Impact\"),o(\"af68afc8\",\"Your Impact goes up every time you help a note get the status of Helpful or Not Helpful.\"),o(\"fb5c5d42\",\"Unlock the ability to write notes\"),o(\"a1e58cdc\",\"Once your Rating Impact reaches 5 or higher, you’ll unlock the ability to write your own Community Notes.\"),o(\"j5f112b4\",\"Two of your recent notes currently have the status of Not Helpful.\"),o(\"ac34c5e8\",\"Enough contributors, including ones who’ve disagreed with each other in their past ratings, agreed that 2 of your notes are not helpful. Here’s their feedback:\"),o(\"ib7886d0\",\"See these notes on your profile\"),o(\"b0a7d360\",\"You’re at risk of being temporarily locked out from writing notes.\"),o(\"e473f876\",\"Contributors whose 5 most recent notes with a status of Helpful or Not Helpful include 3 Not Helpful notes have their ability to write temporarily locked.\"),o(\"ef490ae8\",\"Sources not included or unreliable\"),o(\"bf3dc462\",\"Sources do not support note\"),o(\"heb35e12\",\"Incorrect information\"),o(\"ib117532\",\"Harassment or abuse\"),o(\"a7bc3192\",\"Cites high-quality sources\"),o(\"a26f8dc2\",\"Easy to understand\"),o(\"cbdef06c\",\"Directly addresses the post’s claim\"),o(\"faa5f9e8\",\"Provides important context\"),o(\"gf3b38f4\",\"Neutral or unbiased language\"),o(\"a50327ea\",\"Note not needed on this post\"),o(\"h7c59ea2\",\"Opinion or speculation\"),o(\"d60c0064\",\"Typos or unclear language\"),o(\"e06416ca\",\"Misses key points or irrelevant\"),o(\"cff1aa8c\",\"Argumentative or biased language\"),o(\"c5d55592\",\"Offers unique information or context\"),o(\"f3e6f0aa\",\"Informative\"),o(\"hc2b6a7e\",\"Nonjudgmental and/or empathetic\"),o(\"bbe8b4ac\",\"Opinio