 is not misleading?\"),o(\"b8623176\",\"Why do you believe this video is not misleading?\"),o(\"ec66e3fc\",\"Why do you believe the linked page is not misleading?\"),o(\"g228df26\",\"It expresses a factually correct claim\"),o(\"h890a3f2\",\"It was correct when shared, but is out of date now\"),o(\"hf607a0a\",\"It is clearly satirical/joking\"),o(\"j6ac7742\",\"It expresses a personal opinion\"),o(\"b1d82aae\",\"Did you link to sources you believe most people would consider trustworthy?\"),o(\"ae859ee0\",\"Is your note about the post or the image?\"),o(\"ba84e7f8\",\"Is your note about the post or the video?\"),o(\"ibb784c6\",\"About this specific post\"),o(\"a21ecb8c\",\"About the image in this post, and should appear on all posts that include this image\"),o(\"he0ca8da\",\"About the video in this post, and should appear on all posts that include this video\"),o(\"d0bf8d34\",\"Is your note about the post, or link?\"),o(\"db370b9a\",\"Is your note about the post, image, or link?\"),o(\"c35bf10e\",\"Is your note about the post, video, or link?\"),o(\"d96ce0d2\",\"This note is written in a way that will be helpful on all posts that include this image.\"),o(\"a1fb516c\",\"This note is written in a way that will be helpful on all posts that include this video.\"),o(\"be46a61e\",\"This note is written in a way that will be helpful on all posts that include this media.\"),o(\"ied1c2c2\",\"This note is somewhat specific to this post and might be irrelevant on others.\"),o(\"gb2433df\",function(e){return\"\"+e.noteMatchUrl}),o(\"gdfbdd93\",function(e){return\"all \"+e.matchCount+\" posts\"}),o(\"d7959c4d\",function(e){return\" all \"+e.matchCount+\" posts\"}),o(\"ff5be16d\",function(e){return\" all \"+e.matchCount+\" posts\"}),o(\"abdd8d0a\",\"Edit note\"),o(\"c097608e\",\"Your note doesn’t have an explanation\"),o(\"ba25898c\",\"Notes that explain their sources have a better chance of being rated helpful.\"),o(\"e764d704\",\"Notes that link to trustworthy sources have a better chance of being rated helpful.\"),o(\"gb67e44c\",\"Submit without explanation\"),o(\"d6b758a2\",\"Submit without source\"),o(\"dc1fa12c\",\"Community Notes accounts must have verified phone numbers\"),o(\"a1752fde\",\"To continue contributing to Community Notes from this account, you’ll need to verify your phone number.\"),o(\"hef02710\",\"In addition to verified, your number must be from a trusted phone carrier, and not associated with another Community Notes account.\"),o(\"dff9b6bc\",\"Verify your phone\"),o(\"f051e434\",\"Community Notes contributors must have unique phone numbers\"),o(\"eaef2f72\",\"It looks like there are multiple Community Notes contributors whose X accounts are associated with this phone number.\"),o(\"j78d41b4\",\"In order to continue contributing from this account, you’ll need to remove this phone number from other X accounts.\"),o(\"a7c9a176\",\"Community Notes accounts must have verified phone numbers from a trusted carrier\"),o(\"ec853dfa\",\"To reduce the use of artificially created or virtual phone numbers, phone numbers must be from a trusted carrier.\"),o(\"j6e19c58\",\"Community Notes values\"),o(\"ea580ee2\",\"A quick reminder of the Community Notes values:\"),o(\"eac7b6ac\",\"Contribute to build understanding\"),o(\"b0381cfc\",\"Act in good faith\"),o(\"f0addddc\",\"Be helpful, even to those who disagree\"),o(\"h7c7b204\",\"Help rate existing notes before writing a new one\"),o(\"i8cae552\",\"By rating you’ll help keep quality in Community Notes high.\"),o(\"hd43a218\",\"You’ve reached your daily limit for writing notes\"),o(\"aaba8ed2\",\"To keep note quality high and prevent spam, there’s a limit to the number of notes contributors can write each day, based on their Writing Impact. Please try again later.\"),o(\"a67ed4d6\",\"You’ve reached the limit for adding notes to this author’s posts for now\"),o(\"ic484166\",\"To keep note quality high and prevent spam, there’s a limit to the number of notes one can write on a specific post author in a given time period. The limit is based on how helpful people have found one’s past notes on that author. Please try again later.\"),o(\"b98f077c\",\"Request a Note Info\"),o(\"ee691104\",\"Request a Community Note about this post\"),o(\"j825663a\",\"There’s already a proposed Collaborative Note on the post\"),o(\"f8cbdf02\",\"Think this post is potentially misleading? Request a Community Note.\"),o(\"a9c58d34\",\"You can help rate and improve it.\"),o(\"f132d1be\",\"Contributors will see alerts on posts that get enough requests\"),o(\"gf71296c\",\"If a note is written and rated helpful by other contributors, it will be shown on the post\"),o(\"de0685b4\",\"X doesn’t choose which notes show – Community Notes is by the people, for the people\"),o(\"f8ac3c88\",\"Agree & Request a note\"),o(\"b4917374\",\"Continue Requesting a Note\"),o(\"je9cfe26\",\"See Collaborative Note\"),o(\"a8edd0ea\",\"Add a source?\"),o(\"a39a0de6\",\"Link to an X post\"),o(\"j819c176\",\"Help Community Notes contributors by including a link to an X post that explains what is potentially misleading.\"),o(\"e15b3b44\",\"Link must be to an X post. Example: x.com/user/status/....\"),o(\"i0be4994\",\"Explain?\"),o(\"cefb034e\",\"Explanation\"),o(\"d2f9157a\",\"Help Community Notes contributors by explaining more about what is potentially misleading.\"),o(\"c81085a4\",\"Community Notes\"),o(\"c363515c\",\"available to the public\"),o(\"cb6b0138\",\"Thank you! Your request was sent\"),o(\"f47dcb4c\",\"Thank you! There’s already a proposed Collaborative Note on the post\"),o(\"c196e8b8\",\"If a note is written and rated helpful, you’ll see it on the post.\"),o(\"a9491efa\",\"Community Note request submitted\"),o(\"f060d1cc\",\"Delete request\"),o(\"f499f824\",\"Delete your request\"),o(\"hd1bc518\",\"It may take a few minutes before you can make a new request on this post\"),o(\"geb8d31d\",\"sign up.\"),o(\"gc399930\",\"Daily Limit Note Request Info\"),o(\"fee815e4\",\"You’ve reached your daily limit for requesting notes\"),o(\"i7eb7900\",\"Your daily limit will increase if you make requests on posts that successfully get helpful notes.\"),o(\"d1a3817e\",\"This helps reward people who successfully find potentially misleading posts that could use additional context.\"),o(\"c031c77a\",\"Your daily limit may decrease if you make too many request on posts that people don’t agree need a note.\"),o(\"f87129d2\",\"This helps prevent spam and keep note writers focused on posts that could use helpful notes.\"),o(\"jdd4a572\",\"Your account needs a verified phone number\"),o(\"i0f07c07\",\"Verify your phone\"),o(\"i157c1a8\",\"This request has been deleted.\"),o(\"a9f4ca9c\",\"Community Notes contributors can now see your note\"),o(\"eb8f7c0c\",\"Other contributors can now rate your note\"),o(\"h87c6bd6\",\"Other contributors can now see your note\"),o(\"gc1a5bce\",\"They’ll rate it for helpfulness\"),o(\"i0e950ca\",\"If your note earns a status of Helpful, it will start showing as context to everyone who sees the post\"),o(\"a047e800\",\"Your note is helping other contributors have more context when rating notes\"),o(\"cec8a38c\",\"If your note earns a status of Helpful, you’ll earn Writing Impact.\"),o(\"a377532e\",\"If enough people from different points of view rate it as helpful, it will be shown as context to everyone who sees the post\"),o(\"d790fa4e\",\"Note statuses aren’t defined by majority rule\"),o(\"e90cda68\",\"To identify notes that are helpful to a wide range of people, note statuses require agreement between contributors who have sometimes disagreed in their past ratings.\"),o(\"j5a1d85a\",\"See your note\"),o(\"b25b64d6\",\"Your note was submitted!\"),o(\"g1428d70\",\"Your note is submitted!\"),o(\"a4ec7004\",\"Here’s what happens now:\"),o(\"c4093274\",\"About Community Notes after submission\"),o(\"bc8746a6\",\"Please rate at least one note before writing a new note.\"),o(\"ce3c80b8\",\"Community Notes depends on your ratings to keep quality high.\"),o(\"fa6a075a\",\"Notes suggesting context to be shown with the post\"),o(\"acb7ecae\",\"Notes explaining why added context isn’t needed\"),o(\"d9a5fc06\",\"Rate post\"),o(\"b73cebd2\",\"Rate post and notes\"),o(\"ad8883f2\",\"No notes on this post\"),o(\"c7814e04\",\"No notes suggesting context\"),o(\"efd14e7a\",\"Loading notes\"),o(\"cc5d6270\",\"Contributors have proposed Community Notes about this post\"),o(\"bcc14a68\",\"Community Notes is a program where volunteer contributors add context (called “notes”) to posts they believe could be misleading. Notes below can be rated by contributors, and if they become currently rated helpful, they will shown as context on the post. If a note is currently rated helpful, and you disagree, you can request additional review — meaning more contributors will review the note, and its rating could change. \"),o(\"c21313ba\",\"Notes currently rated not helpful\"),o(\"c2c40120\",\"Show all notes\"),o(\"ia596d40\",\"See anything you’d like to improve?\"),o(\"deff0bde\",\"Write a note\"),o(\"i8e85ef8\",\"Join Community Notes and gain access to note writing and other features to help create a better-informed world\"),o(\"af88892a\",\"These notes are added by Community Notes contributors who believe the post is potentially misleading, and would benefit from additional context.\"),o(\"cf8a40a6\",\"Notes are only visible in Community Notes, until they are rated Helpful by enough contributors.\"),o(\"g22c8c30\",\"If these notes are rated Helpful by enough contributors, including those who typically disagree in their past ratings, they start showing publicly with the post as added context.\"),o(\"jf04b084\",\"These notes are added by contributors who believe the post isn’t misleading and does not need additional context.\"),o(\"g5a72e98\",\"These are only visible in Community Notes as additional information to raters, and are not shown as context with the post, even if they earn the status of Helpful.\"),o(\"b8719c22\",\"Help identify whether posts are liked by people from different perspectives.\"),o(\"jcdf97d4\",\"What do you like about the post?\"),o(\"d4d7b67e\",\"What don’t you like about the post?\"),o(\"ed5156fa\",\"There was an error saving your rating, please try again.\"),o(\"d0ed3636\",\"You rated this post\"),o(\"j6aa6172\",\"Delete rating?\"),o(\"i4112750\",\"This can’t be undone.\"),o(\"i6f6191a\",\"Thank you!\"),o(\"h5575012\",\"Agree and submit\"),o(\"f9171e52\",\"This post got some likes from people who normally disagree, but input so far is limited.\"),o(\"j0f9919a\",\"Your rating won’t negatively impact a post, but can help positively recognize posts that are widely liked.\"),o(\"b3af830c\",\"Your input:\"),o(\"d0b29562\",\"Rate more posts now\"),o(\"i36ea87a\",\"I agree with it\"),o(\"d5befc34\",\"I learned something interesting\"),o(\"je26ecf2\",\"It makes a meaningful point\"),o(\"e4e331aa\",\"It’s unifying on a topic that’s often polarizing\"),o(\"ed61ff2a\",\"It’s heartwarming or endearing\"),o(\"gc3104d8\",\"It’s inspiring or exciting\"),o(\"j8c4400e\",\"It’s funny\"),o(\"j4738406\",\"N/A: There’s nothing I like about it\"),o(\"d93d1666\",\"I don’t agree with it\"),o(\"d6130466\",\"There is no meaningful substance to it\"),o(\"d96835b6\",\"It doesn’t interest me\"),o(\"b7ba4150\",\"N/A: There’s nothing I dislike about it\"),o(\"g0402b3b\",\"liked by people from different perspectives\"),o(\"ged62c2b\",\"spotlight\"),o(\"b5d5f7f1\",\"Shapes the direction\"),o(\"a42fef87\",\"Learn more\"),o(\"bd7eb888\",\"See all notes on this post\"),o(\"e9c06de2\",\"Show note evaluation results\"),o(\"f7d00334\",\"Hide note evaluation results\"),o(\"i97b83f6\",\"There was an error submitting your appeal, please try again.\"),o(\"a038ab9a\",\"Translate note\"),o(\"a4ed2718\",\"Collaborative Note · AI-drafted, updates with community input\"),o(\"d3916474\",\"Revision history\"),o(\"je48dc24\",\"Show my work\"),o(\"a751fc66\",\"Hide my work\"),o(\"icdb6d74\",\"Proposed by an e