window to submit your handle inquiry.\"),o(\"f06b124e\",\"Frequently asked questions\"),o(\"h677fdcc\",\"How are handles priced?\"),o(\"a55b39aa\",\"Primarily based on character length and word commonality. Prices start at $10k and range up to over $500k USD.\"),o(\"d46bcb3a\",\"How do I know if a handle is available to purchase?\"),o(\"c6bcf72c\",\"Send us a request using the Get Started button, and we will let you know if it’s available.\"),o(\"d478604c\",\"Can I purchase a handle on behalf of another business?\"),o(\"c09f8cd2\",\"No. Businesses can only purchase handles on behalf of their affiliates that are genuinely connected to their business.\"),o(\"d814f020\",\"What is the sales process? How long does it take?\"),o(\"f600b6f0\",\"Request a handle purchase or swap using the Get Started button. We’ll respond with availability and pricing within 3 business days. After payment, we’ll transfer the handle to your chosen account within 1-2 days. Optionally, we can move the old handle to another account you own.\"),o(\"i8debc4a\",\"Do you offer discounts for multiple handles?\"),o(\"c5199f3c\",\"Yes, depending on the number of handles you purchase and the total size of the quote.\"),o(\"c20f923e\",\"I have a trademark - does that affect things?\"),o(\"b2fd4c15\",\"Trademark Policy\"),o(\"a690746e\",\"Get Priority Support\"),o(\"he2dc9b0\",\"Contact us by sending your organization’s handle and request details.\"),o(\"ed85ca9e\",\"Contact us by sending your business’s handle and request details.\"),o(\"e5e6479e\",\"Send us an email with your organization’s handle and the details of your inquiry to receive the fastest support.\"),o(\"dd0855d0\",\"Send us an email with your business’s handle and the details of your inquiry to receive the fastest support.\"),o(\"ica8392a\",\"Once we receive your request, we’ll review and prioritize it in the order it was received.\"),o(\"ed37e36e\",\"Important: Missing your organization’s handle or using a personal email may cause delays